<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Unblocked Space</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 { color: #00ffcc; }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 500px;
            border: 2px solid #00ffcc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #000;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p>This page is hosted on GitHub Pages.</p>
        
        <!-- You can replace this src URL with any embeddable web app or proxy tool -->
        <iframe src="https://example.com" title="Embedded Content"></iframe>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
<iframe src="https://spotify.com" width="100%" height="380" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; player"></iframe>
```

### How to Use It
* **Copy** the code block above.
* **Paste** the code directly into the HTML source or code block of your website or blog. 
* **Adjust** the `width` or `height` values in the code if you want to change the player size.

